{
  "schema": "web-ui-page/1",
  "title": "🌊 FFSS 利用ガイド",
  "theme": "auto",
  "description": "FluidFullSpeedSimulation — 水・エタノール・メタノールなどの作動流体で、流れ・遅れ・検証を整数演算で回すシミュレーター。",
  "favicon": "./assets/brand/favicon.png",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "badges",
      "items": [
        "🧮 整数演算（Q 固定小数点）",
        "🧰 実行は標準ライブラリのみ",
        "🐍 Python 3.11+"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "📥 取得",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "output",
          "text": "git clone https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/FluidFullSpeedSimulation.git\ncd FluidFullSpeedSimulation\nuv sync --locked"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "▶️ 実行",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🗂️ 実験の一覧",
          "text": "",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python fluidfullspeedsimulation.py list\n🧮 E01 tank-integrator  水槽は積分器（整数で厳密）\n💧 E02 fluid-drain  流体ごとの排水（細管 / 小孔）\n⏳ E03 transport-delay  管を通る遅れ\n🪜 E04 weir  堰とカム（非線形の出口）\n🎈 E05 float-valve  浮き弁と遅れ\n🌐 E06 coupled-loop  2 台連結（遅延つきの環）\n…"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🧪 流体の物性",
          "text": "",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python fluidfullspeedsimulation.py fluids\n💧 🟦 water           ρ=998.21 kg/m³  μ=1.0016 mPa·s  ν=1.003 mm²/s\n🍶 🟨 ethanol         ρ=789.45 kg/m³  μ=1.2 mPa·s  ν=1.52 mm²/s\n🧴 🟧 methanol        ρ=791.1 kg/m³  μ=0.587 mPa·s  ν=0.742 mm²/s\n🟢 🟩 namekian-water  ρ=998.21 kg/m³  μ=0.80128 mPa·s  ν=0.8027 mm²/s  🏷️ 仮置き（粘度は水の 0.8 倍）\n☠️ 🟪 poison-water    ρ=998.21 kg/m³  μ=5.008 mPa·s  ν=5.017 mm²/s  🏷️ 仮置き（粘度は水の 5 倍）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🎋 1 本だけ回す",
          "text": "名前でもアイコン（🥢 など）でも選べます。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python fluidfullspeedsimulation.py run flume\n✅ E08 🎋 flume  38/38"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "✅ 全実験を検証",
          "text": "終了コード 0 / 1。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python fluidfullspeedsimulation.py verify"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🎨 場面を描く",
          "text": "GIF・PNG と受領記録 JSON を書きます。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python fluidfullspeedsimulation.py draw 🥢 --view files"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
